BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>The Solar System's neighbours</h1>
Alpha Centauri (A and B on their 80-year orbit, Proxima), Barnard's Star,
Epsilon Eridani and TRAPPIST-1 as bodies, moving with the sky's
catalogue. A delta-glider orbits Proxima: the global frame's origin moves
to its system, its orbit held to the metre; one in low Earth orbit waits
on its conic.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 57388.0
  Script Tests/SystemsTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship PRX
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET PRX
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
PRX:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Proxima
  ELEMENTS 2.0e9 0.00000 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 57388.0
  AROT 0 0 0
END
LEO:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 7.0e6 0.00000 0.0 0.0 0.0 0.0 57388.0
  AROT 0 0 0
END
END_SHIPS
